<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-15915] .NET thin: SSL keystore shouldn&apos;t be a mandatory parameter</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-15915</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Currently, SslStreamFactory can&apos;t be configured without specifying client-side certificates. &lt;br/&gt;
This shouldn&apos;t be the case - SSL can be used without any certificates on the client.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Workaround:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;class &lt;/span&gt;SimpleSslStreamFactory : ISslStreamFactory {
    &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;public&lt;/span&gt; SslStream Create(Stream stream, string targetHost)
    {
        &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;var&lt;/span&gt; sslStream = &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;new&lt;/span&gt; SslStream(stream, &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;false&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;null&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;null&lt;/span&gt;);
        sslStream.AuthenticateAsClient(targetHost);
        &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; sslStream;
    }
}
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
